---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import photo from '../../assets/bio-photo.jpg';
import { site, socialLinks } from '../data/site';
---

<section class="bio" aria-labelledby="bio-title">
  <Image
    src={photo}
    alt="Michael VanDyke laughing at a restaurant table at night, in a tan cap, round glasses, a light gray blazer, and a black shirt with a copper floral print."
    widths={[320, 480, 720]}
    sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 20rem, 100vw"
    loading="lazy"
  />
  <div class="text">
    <h2 id="bio-title">Hi, I'm Michael</h2>
    <p>
      I'm a software engineering leader, a visual artist, and a lifelong maker. I lead distributed
      engineering teams through modernization work: moving old systems into the cloud, building
      observability, and making decisions with data. I stay close to the code, mostly Swift and iOS,
      Python, TypeScript, traditional AI and ML, and AWS.
    </p>
    <p>
      As a kid, I used to take apart remote controls just to see the circuits, and pull pans out of
      the cabinets to play them like an instrument; not much has changed. These days that means
      woodworking, electronics on the bench, painting, and interactive pieces. The overlap
      between engineering and the creative arts is where I'm most at home.
    </p>
    <p>I live in Louisville, Kentucky.</p>
    <ul class="links">
      {socialLinks.map((link) => <li><a href={link.href}>{link.label}</a></li>)}
      {site.email && <li><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>Email</a></li>}
      <li><a href="/resume/">Work with me</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bio {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .bio :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 22rem;
    height: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .text {
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }

  .links {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: var(--space-3) 0 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-1) var(--space-3);
  }

  .links a {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.3rem 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .bio {
      grid-template-columns: 18rem minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-4);
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 64rem) {
    .bio {
      grid-template-columns: 22rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
